  "description": "A new model in the Ristretto line. This clean looking bike is build around a lightweight welded Cromoly steel frame with an aluminum fork. Thick stays and leather washers keep mud guards stable and silent. A Creme saddle and gummy Creme grips with alluminium bar ends look elegant and are a pleasure to touch. A stainless steel front rack is super practical for carrying luggage. Fitted with a 7-speed Shimano Nexus internal geared hub and belt drive system that is service free. Finished in a high-end multi layer matte paint with a powder clear coat in Colbolt. The Roadster ST is available with a step-through version in Ruby. This clean looking bicycle is the perfect choice for your everyday commute.",
